  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Front Line Defenders - Protection Support for Women Human rights Defenders Globally, 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme Front Line Defenders (FLD) will provide rapid and practical security support to Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) at risk in fragile contexts, specifically by supporting Women Human Rights Defenders (WHRDs) with protection strategies informed by gendered and intersectional dimensions of risk. The objective will be achieved through provision of protection grants to WHRDs, tailored well-being and psychosocial support, and capacity building, including development of visibility for protection strategies and training on advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
